From: sysretq0 <324514544+sysretq0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 08:20:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] usb: musb-new: Add generic MediaTek MUSB glue driver

Change-Id: I129b57b3ca2dd3fbc25192cdfdeca59b69289264
Signed-off-by: sysretq0 <324514544+sysretq0@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 drivers/usb/musb-new/Kconfig    |   8 +
 drivers/usb/musb-new/Makefile   |   1 +
 drivers/usb/musb-new/mediatek.c | 277 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
